{"c":[{"id":"a0b0f28c36e2208f","sum":"Cults updateCreation treats numeric downloadPrice 0 as paid (needs >= 0.5; h7 run 38833253910). A free listing omits it. New files are added only after that update succeeds, and the previous set is removed then; a failed update leaves the new files added.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261016T011032Z-693e0a376cc1e681","text":"Cults updateCreation on h7 run 38833253910 rejected downloadPrice 0: price must be >= 0.5. Publisher sends 0 only when that argument is non-null. createBlueprint and createIllustration already ran, so destroy did not.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261016T012019Z-f21f69d0989bdb0e","text":"A free Cults listing omits downloadPrice. updateCreation treated numeric 0 as a paid price and required >= 0.5. New files are added only after that update succeeds; the previous set is removed then.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"57aa9a8ffdf28805","sum":"A free Cults updateCreation must send downloadPrice 0: omitting it fails 'Price must be >= 0.5' even with only id (run 38835243248; probed 2026-10-16), though the schema defaults it to null (EUR, openPriced false). 0 succeeds and the listing stays free.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261016T013256Z-cf0800ebabd19f13","text":"Cults updateCreation schema defaults currency to EUR and openPriced to false, and downloadPrice to null. Omitting downloadPrice still fails with Price must be >= 0.5 (run 38835243248), so omission does not mean free on update.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261016T013603Z-56cd1932a8c14a46","text":"Cults updateCreation without downloadPrice fails 'Price must be >= 0.5' even with only id (probed live 2026-10-16). downloadPrice 0 succeeds and the listing stays free. A free update must send downloadPrice 0.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
